cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rules from the Cubature Atlas, please cite the atlas and the rule id. Rules from the literature must also be cited with their original publication."
title: "Cubature Atlas: best known quadrature and cubature rules with positive weights"
abstract: "Smallest known quadrature and cubature rules with positive weights on the interval, triangle, square, tetrahedron and cube, degrees 1 to 30, one file per rule, with moment checks and Newton-Kantorovich certificates. The search, computations, code and texts were generated by an AI (Claude, Anthropic), commissioned and directed by the author."
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Kubitz
    given-names: Jörg
repository-code: "https://github.com/jukzi/cubature_atlas"
url: "https://jukzi.github.io/cubature_atlas/"
keywords:
  - cubature
  - quadrature
  - numerical integration
  - cubature rules
  - quadrature rules
  - positive weights
  - finite element method
  - triangle
  - tetrahedron
  - cube
